---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import DocCards from '../components/DocCards.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { url, sectionDocs } from '../lib/content';
---
<SiteLayout title="交流与实践 · 蜂巢" description="了解蜂巢的设计取舍、典型业务任务、ACDL研发方法与HiveFlow自动化实践。">
  <section class="page-intro container">
    <span class="eyebrow">交流与实践</span>
    <h1>产品之外，还有值得说明的工程取舍</h1>
    <p>从架构取舍到真实业务例子，记录为什么这样建设蜂巢，把内部交流材料整理成可以持续阅读的公开记录。</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section container no-top-padding">
    <DocCards docs={sectionDocs('insights')} />
    <div class="related-acdl" data-reveal data-spotlight>
      <span class="eyebrow">关联实践</span>
      <h2>蜂巢的研发方法与自动化实践</h2>
      <p>ACDL介绍如何组织需求、设计、实施与验证；HiveFlow介绍如何把开发者反馈接到调查、开发和交付。</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button primary" href="https://www.bluexiii.com/acdl/">前往ACDL网站<Icon name="external" size={17} /></a>
        <a class="button" href="https://www.bluexiii.com/flow/">前往HiveFlow网站<Icon name="external" size={17} /></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="end-note container" data-reveal>
    <p>现有交流材料按当前产品重新整理。历史演示、设计意图与真实环境验证各有适用范围，不能互相替代。</p>
    <a class="inline-link" href={url('/docs/')}>回到文档中心<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
